    "name": "Astronormous Survivor",
    "steam_appid": 3333020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Astronormous Survivor</strong>, a top-down 3D space combat game where you start small and steadily build your ship into a staggering powerhouse. Inspired by 90s mecha toys, this game lets you customize and expand your spacecraft, taking on waves of progressively larger enemies in a vast and thrilling universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333020/extras/b9e2353c6fcedc0404f3e5d3abc5200c.poster.avif?t=1732014316\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333020/extras/b9e2353c6fcedc0404f3e5d3abc5200c.webm?t=1732014316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333020/extras/b9e2353c6fcedc0404f3e5d3abc5200c.mp4?t=1732014316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Growth Potential:</strong> Begin with a modest ship and build it up to immense size, adding modules, weapons, and defenses. The more you grow, the more formidable foes you\u2019ll encounter, each battle more epic than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90s Toy-Inspired Design:</strong> Immerse yourself in a retro aesthetic that brings the charm of 90s mecha toys to life, with colorful, detailed parts and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Space Combat:</strong> Engage in strategic, high-intensity combat where movement and positioning are key. Equip your ship with powerful tools to dodge, defend, and defeat relentless waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333020/extras/acfa81223e456651af10bcf4ea7a41d4.poster.avif?t=1732014316\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333020/extras/acfa81223e456651af10bcf4ea7a41d4.webm?t=1732014316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333020/extras/acfa81223e456651af10bcf4ea7a41d4.mp4?t=1732014316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Enemy Scaling:</strong> Encounter enemies that scale with your ship\u2019s size and power. From nimble attackers to gigantic battleships, each battle introduces new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Customization:</strong> Experiment with a vast array of modules and enhancements, building a ship tailored to your combat style and adaptable to different challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>Navigate through a procedurally generated galaxy, facing tougher foes as you expand and enhance your ship. Gather resources, collect rare modules, and forge a uniquely powerful spacecraft ready to take on colossal adversaries.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Astronormous Survivor</strong>, a top-down 3D space combat game where you start small and steadily build your ship into a staggering powerhouse. Inspired by 90s mecha toys, this game lets you customize and expand your spacecraft, taking on waves of progressively larger enemies in a vast and thrilling universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333020/extras/b9e2353c6fcedc0404f3e5d3abc5200c.poster.avif?t=1732014316\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333020/extras/b9e2353c6fcedc0404f3e5d3abc5200c.webm?t=1732014316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333020/extras/b9e2353c6fcedc0404f3e5d3abc5200c.mp4?t=1732014316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Growth Potential:</strong> Begin with a modest ship and build it up to immense size, adding modules, weapons, and defenses. The more you grow, the more formidable foes you\u2019ll encounter, each battle more epic than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90s Toy-Inspired Design:</strong> Immerse yourself in a retro aesthetic that brings the charm of 90s mecha toys to life, with colorful, detailed parts and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Space Combat:</strong> Engage in strategic, high-intensity combat where movement and positioning are key. Equip your ship with powerful tools to dodge, defend, and defeat relentless waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333020/extras/acfa81223e456651af10bcf4ea7a41d4.poster.avif?t=1732014316\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333020/extras/acfa81223e456651af10bcf4ea7a41d4.webm?t=1732014316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333020/extras/acfa81223e456651af10bcf4ea7a41d4.mp4?t=1732014316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Enemy Scaling:</strong> Encounter enemies that scale with your ship\u2019s size and power. From nimble attackers to gigantic battleships, each battle introduces new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Customization:</strong> Experiment with a vast array of modules and enhancements, building a ship tailored to your combat style and adaptable to different challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br>Navigate through a procedurally generated galaxy, facing tougher foes as you expand and enhance your ship. Gather resources, collect rare modules, and forge a uniquely powerful spacecraft ready to take on colossal adversaries.</p>",
    "short_description": "Build your ship from humble beginnings to epic proportions in Astronormous Survivor. Battle scaling enemies, unlock new modules, and experience thrilling space combat with a retro 90s mecha vibe.",
